# Single source of truth for bootstrap env vars passed via SSH SendEnv.
#
# Three sites must keep this list in lockstep:
#   1. scripts/do-bootstrap.sh  — writes /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/subkit.conf
#                                 with one `AcceptEnv <NAME>` per variable
#                                 (sshd silently rejects globs longer than
#                                 ~256 chars in a single AcceptEnv line).
#   2. scripts/deploy.sh        — passes `-o SendEnv=<comma-list>` to ssh.
#   3. .github/workflows/release.yml — same SendEnv option.
#
# This file is the canonical list. Each script reads it directly so a
# new variable lands in one place. Format: one variable per line,
# blank lines and `#` comments ignored.

# Engine release coordinates.
ENGINE_VERSION

# Admin bearer for the post-health PUT /v1/settings/* phase.
VERIFY_API_KEY

# Bootstrap LLM provisioning — eat-own-dog-food path. All optional;
# absent vars skip their PUT.
BOOTSTRAP_LLM_PROVIDER
BOOTSTRAP_LLM_API_KEY
BOOTSTRAP_LLM_MODEL
BOOTSTRAP_LLM_FALLBACK_PROVIDER
BOOTSTRAP_LLM_FALLBACK_MODEL
